href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T10:42:02.989443+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1298,"images":11,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T10:30:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T10:58:37.808107+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T10:38:40.126729+00:00","content_hash":"a1763f906440c7effb845fcaae3245a92c30e5e164167df65b0d43f2d0fa76ec","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}